## 2️⃣ Hotels – **right in the centre**, a few steps from the top attractions

| # | Hotel | Distance to Charles Bridge / Old Town Square | Price (2 adults, double‑room, 7 nights, Dec 2024) | Rating (TripAdvisor / Booking.com) | Highlights |
|---|-------|----------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|------------|
| **A** | **Hotel Paris Prague** (4‑star) | 300 m (≈ 4 min walk) | **€115 – €150** (breakfast included) | 4.5 / 9.0 | Art‑Nouveau façade, rooftop terrace with city view, spa, free Wi‑Fi |
| **B** | **Hotel Kings Court** (5‑star) | 350 m (≈ 5 min) | **€180 – €240** (breakfast included) | 4.7 / 9.2 | Luxury lobby, indoor pool, fitness centre, on‑site restaurant “Café Kings” |
| **C** | **Hotel U Prince** (4‑star) | 150 m (≈ 2 min) – **directly on Old Town Square** | **€130 – €170** (breakfast included) | 4.4 / 8.9 | Views of the Astronomical Clock, rooftop bar, pet‑friendly |
| **D** | **Mosaic House** (Boutique, 4‑star) | 400 m (≈ 5 min) – eco‑friendly design | **€120 – €155** (breakfast included) | 4.6 / 9.1 | Green roof, organic breakfast, bike‑rental service |
| **E** | **Hotel Josef** (Design, 4‑star) | 450 m (≈ 6 min) – modern loft‑style rooms | **€110 – €140** (breakfast included) | 4.5 / 9.0 | Rooftop jacuzzi, co‑working space, 24 h reception |

